ModulePharmacyName=Pharmacy dispensing
ModulePharmacyDesc=Dispensing and expiry: dispense signed prescriptions with FEFO batch picking, returns with reverse stock, expiry alerts
ModulePharmacyDescLong=Pharmacy module for TCM clinics: create a dispense sheet from a signed prescription; confirming deducts stock with FEFO (first-expiry-first-out) batch allocation and fails the whole sheet on shortage; a return books the batches back in and allows re-dispensing; dispense sheet PDF; expiry alert page and daily cron (WeCom push off by default). Dispensing is idempotent; the prescription state moves through modPrescription bridge methods.
